WEBVTT

00:02:28.121 --> 00:02:30.163
ham jaanate hain ki
hamen kya kahana hai

00:02:30.204 --> 00:02:31.788
aur kaise kahana chaahate
hain

00:02:31.871 --> 00:02:33.954
Ham aage kahaan jaana
chaahate hain?

00:02:33.954 --> 00:02:35.871
Ek ekshan aaitam do

00:02:35.871 --> 00:02:38.204
Aap logon ko yah kahakar
sakate hain ki vo

00:02:38.204 --> 00:02:39.913
kya kahana aur

00:02:39.913 --> 00:02:42.496
karane vaale hain

00:02:42.496 --> 00:02:45.954
Yeh mere baare mein ek
sadhaaran tathy hai

00:02:45.954 --> 00:02:48.871
Isalie mainne ek smamaany
samasyako hal karane

00:02:48.871 --> 00:02:50.788
ke lie apane aane ka istemaal
kiya

00:02:50.788 --> 00:02:52.288
Mainne nimnalikhit eemel bhejha

00:02:52.288 --> 00:02:54.704
“Namaskaar, mujhe 
aapkee madade chaahie”

00:02:54.704 --> 00:02:57.913
Mujhe apanee shushk tvacha 
ke lie ek loshan zaroorat hai

00:02:57.913 --> 00:03:00.371
Main traans ke roop mein
bhee baahar aa rihi hoon